{"server":"tw","storyId":"act17side_level_act17side_10_beg","groupId":"act17side","stageId":"act17side_10","title":"禮儀廣場","storyCode":"SN-10","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"cf10ba8e82349b19c635f7eab8f3233c6a8848d5cd4ea4671dca078d70a35f14","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亞之眼。距離我上一次來到這裡，已經過了很久很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無數懲戒軍的戰士犧牲於此，海嗣最終衝垮了我們的防線，無數工程師枉死在燈塔內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在最後一艘船被吞沒之前，我們撤離了這裡，十不存一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，現在，看那。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"燈火！"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡門的聲音久違地有些顫抖。\n凱爾希沉默地眺望著遠處礁石的中央。巨大的燈塔，照亮天空，如同白晝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒看見船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是個好兆頭，說明他們找到了他們想要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前進吧。只要燈火還沒有熄滅，我們就能前進。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（環繞著大門蠕動的窸窣聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......Mon3tr。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（尖嘯）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"清理大門，我們進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"火的溫度。\n這些恐魚聚集在門口，徘徊，旋轉。\n卡門的視線掃向遠方，他看見這些可憎怪物焦黑的屍體一路陳列，沒入風中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐魚不會恐懼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但它們懂得趨利避害，本能教會了它們如何謹慎地狩獵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......它們在懼怕。即使這些生物不懂得何為國家，更不屑於律法與道德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但它們仍在懼怕伊比利亞的大審判官，懼怕我們構建在文明之上的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達里奧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希沒有說話。\n她看得見。她看得見散發著一片螢光的地面上，有一個詭異的環。\n焦黑的屍體堆積成山，成千上萬同胞的死亡令恐魚養成了全新的習性——\n——不要靠近那座塔。\n微弱的火苗仍在燃燒。這本是一場大火。\n而在恐魚如浪潮般死去前，這裡本沒有可燃物。\n火焰的中心站著一個人。他提著燈，拄著劍，就像年輕時受訓站崗那樣，一動不動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無言的達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達里奧，你做得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安息吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i31"},{"type":"narration","text":"達里奧手中的提燈彷彿呼應著卡門的道別，火焰瞬間吞沒了更多的恐魚，熊熊大火將已無聲息的大審判官包裹其中。\n他早已渾濁的雙眼仍看著遠方。\n卡門在達里奧如雕塑般的身軀前沉默良久。\n凱爾希沒有打斷卡門的哀悼。她只是捕捉著眼中的事物，這裡沒有太多獵人的痕跡。\n只有大審判官獨自一人，與恐魚持續不停地廝殺，至死方休。\n而哪怕戰士早已力竭而亡，那些恐魚仍然忌憚他。因為火沒有滅，燈沒有暗淡。\n審判官將自己化作了一種現象，誓死捍衛了伊比利亞之眼的純潔。\n良久，卡門抬起頭。\n凱爾希這才從眼前這位高齡老人的身上看見歲月的痕跡。即使審判庭用了各種手段延續他的生命，但此刻，他仍舊掩飾不住眼中的疲憊。\n他回過頭，看向凱爾希，又看了看逐漸沒入火焰中的達里奧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g20_lighthouse_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是我最好的學生，凱爾希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們有三分鐘時間惋惜這位戰士的死。等火焰熄滅，恐魚便沒有了築巢的障礙。它們會蜂擁而至。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我沒看見那個女孩。至少達里奧的弟子活了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡沒有更高級的海嗣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"數量不足為懼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"只是“暫時”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得尋找一勞永逸的辦法。伊比利亞之眼由布雷奧甘建造，它有機會成為與阿戈爾建立聯繫的終端。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前提是她們已經找到了那艘船......慢著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰重新啟動了伊比利亞之眼？阿戈爾人和達里奧都應該是初來乍到......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......看來在上面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g20_lighthouse_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......總算......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊......哈啊......控、控制台沒事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，岔氣了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（好奇的低鳴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊——哇——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......我得承認，你做得確實超乎我們想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你一個人就重新點亮了伊比利亞之眼，至少有三成功能可重新投入使用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你一個人。在這個環境下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你是極境先生的那個......啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審、審判官閣下呢？！他一直在下面死戰，我、我不敢靠近他，也沒法幫他，我只能在這裡守著主控板......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他犧牲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他的犧牲絕非沒有意義，捍衛信念的犧牲即是個體存在的延續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他以審判庭的審判官，伊比利亞的衛道士的身份英勇戰死，他理想中的自己永遠留在了伊比利亞的海岸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少，你，阿戈爾人。你捍衛了他犧牲的意義。你堅持到了現在，沒有放棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做得不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......大、大審判官閣下他......我和他說話不多......但他......呃......咕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，格蘭法洛呢......我的家怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......換作平時，我不會回答市民的每一個提問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在......我並不想欺騙你。格蘭法洛很快會被懲戒軍接管，市民將受到統一管制，並為前線哨站的搭建出力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......蒂亞戈死了，死在異教徒的手中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼會？！蒂亞戈叔叔他——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他早就意識到了深海教徒的存在，但他視而不見。他的包庇讓懲戒軍的計畫受阻，也拖延了我們支援這裡的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使他逃過一劫，我也不會放過他，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"喬迪癱軟地坐在地上。\n他感到疲憊和麻木。他感到先前始終繃著的那根弦就這麼輕易地斷開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......蒂亞戈叔叔......為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......Mon3tr，守住入口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（歡快地附和）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......能確認“愚人號”最後一次出現的位置嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"並不遠。而且，最後一次記錄在四十八小時內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她始終都還能發出訊號？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"布雷奧甘幫助伊比利亞王族建立燈塔與艦隊，何嘗不是為了重新取得與家園的聯繫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亞之眼也好，“愚人號”某處隱蔽角落的發信裝置也罷，都毫無保留地使用了阿戈爾的技術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，這一切的前提是，海嗣沒有摧毀那艘船，或是把那裡當做了巢穴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡門沉默地順著光芒延展的方向，看向遠端的海平面。\n肉眼捕捉不到“愚人號”的方向，大海太過寬闊，所謂的“不遠”在陸地上依然是糟糕的玩笑。\n初顯疲態的聖徒再一次露出了符合其年齡的表情。他嘴唇微動，似有千萬種想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿方索......加西亞......圖雷......茱莉婭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們還在那裡嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g25_goldenboat_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......隊長和歌蕾蒂婭，他們追進海裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我們得去幫他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，在這待著比較好。海水躁動不安，海嗣的氣味混雜在一起，也許不止那一隻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽見什麼了嗎？斯卡蒂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......沒什麼啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你們把這裡變成了什麼樣？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，阿戈爾人，你們是怎麼進來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有我有這裡的鑰匙，而在老飯桶死了以後，我就把鑰匙丟進海裡了！已經過了五十多年！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這是這艘運輸工具的動力設施，把這裡鎖上，不是等於放棄希望嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老飯桶是最後一個工程師，他死了，沒有人可以修復這艘船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何況那時......“海嗣”已經纏上我們了，我們走不掉的。我的船上不需要動搖的船員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回答我的問題，你們在這裡找到了什麼！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布雷奧甘。隊長循著他留下的線索追到了伊比利亞，追到了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們......認識那個造船的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我沒什麼印象。畢竟我算是“技術”這邊的。藝術也是一種技術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這沒什麼好奇怪的，如果想回到阿戈爾，就順著阿戈爾人的線索找——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，骯髒的行為，你們甚至翻出了布雷奧甘的私人物品......難道阿戈爾的傳統是不尊重彼此的隱私嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"上面寫著什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布雷奧甘在陸地上的見聞，像是篇遊記吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"二隊長就是在找這種東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。你為什麼不問問她本人呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那只是一小部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無功而返，哼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它不見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另一個消息是，我們之所以放棄了深追，是因為附近出現了其他海嗣的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們沿著遙遠的氣味而來，族群發出聲響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不介意就這樣大開殺戒。但在那之前，我們得先解決這艘船的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們還敢覬覦我的伊比利亞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有這艘船能讓我們回到阿戈爾。也只有這艘船，才能聯繫上阿戈爾的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於維修的事項，我也許比對布雷奧甘的技術一知半解的伊比利亞人稍強一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不可能放棄這個機會，哪怕要動用武力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四對二，哼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（警惕的咆哮）——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三對三。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......隊長？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼著急，歌蕾蒂婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了我說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這不是我們放棄回到阿戈爾的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道阿戈爾現在是什麼樣，我告訴你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非巢穴和生存領地受到威脅，海嗣從不主動進攻城市。每一次屠殺，每一次毀滅，背後都有阿戈爾人中的墮落者推波助瀾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們以為我們死了。他們和我們失去了聯繫。我們的體內流著海嗣的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在與這些生物對抗的漫長歲月裡，現在，是少見的良機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少數的墮落難道就與那些渣滓無關了嗎？即使放任不管，海嗣的領土也依舊會無序地膨脹，直至將海洋吃乾抹淨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是兩個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這兩個問題，不是你回到家園，重整軍隊，再度出征就能迎刃而解的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們為什麼不換個思路處理問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你選擇聽那些下等生物的話，和它們同行，與它們同知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們說，我們是同族。但我們並不瞭解它們，並不足夠瞭解它們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至無法瞭解看見的。在得到關於它們神祇的答案之前，做多少都是盲目徒勞的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，你這是什麼意思！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你和海嗣......你怎麼能保證最後站在我們這邊？你為什麼要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自以為能從海嗣那裡得到什麼的獵人，最後都失蹤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，您應該比我更清楚才是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"它們的低語......共鳴......它們會鑽進你的腦子，那和你的想法無關！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......斯卡蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是......兩個問題。具體的，就讓歌蕾蒂婭轉述給你們吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"船長，送她們下船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正合我意，阿戈爾人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......很遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂&幽靈鯊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉默，寂靜。久別的獵人，似乎總是得不到一個理想的重逢。\n有什麼蠕動在斯卡蒂和幽靈鯊的心口。大副在猶豫，傷口還在隱隱作痛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"劍拔弩張。\n安靜。\n太安靜了。\n等等，怎麼會？浪濤聲，風聲，被海嗣砸開的船體吱呀作響的聲音——\n都在遠去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"獵人們......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這艘船，在航行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在胡說什麼呢，舊伊比利亞人......已經多少年......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！千真萬確！有什麼東西在推著這艘船，而且......而且恐怕在我們圍獵那隻海嗣的時候，一直都在航行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......從剛才開始，呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"周圍好像，異常安靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同類，聚集。馱起方盒，遠去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟上......我們跟上。我們找到暴風的盡頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（溫順地搖了搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海浪在消逝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寂靜，將臨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g22_goldenboat_hall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼聲音都沒有。這麼多年的浪潮聲，為什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一切，都和那天一樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（痛苦地低下身子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加西亞！呃......我的手，它在顫抖......該死，要不是為了打獵，我早就砍下這隻手了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈爾人，這是怎麼回事！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂婭沒有回答。\n她不被察覺地摸了摸自己的脖頸，鱗片，她體內不屬於她的那部分，正在與什麼產生共鳴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣的氣味......海的味道，都消失了。看看外面，太平靜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊......怎麼回事？為什麼這麼沉重......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們聽見什麼了嗎？這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“海洋陷入前所未有的平靜，海岸出現異樣，劇烈的退潮和不規律的波濤宣告著災難來臨。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“一切聲響都被覆蓋。從海浪拍岸到城市的鐘塔，一切響動都逐漸消亡。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"直到人們的話語聲，都消失不見。\n直到風也安靜下來。\n大靜謐悄然而至。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能，就和審判庭記載的一樣，我們面對著......一次新的靜謐！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯊魚，你去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去上面看看情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，斯卡蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和歌蕾蒂婭留在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......斯卡蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"待在歌蕾蒂婭身邊，然後記住一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你永遠是我們的獵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勞倫緹娜，我們走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g21_goldenboat_deck"},{"type":"narration","text":"幽靈鯊仰頭看向天空。\n陰雲不知何時散去，對時間已經失去概念的她發現，現在正是滿天星河。\n她始終能聽見那個聲音。\n呼喚她的聲音。\n幽靈鯊踱步在甲板上，烏爾比安投來了擔憂的視線，僅僅一瞬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你和隊長的嗅覺比較敏銳，你能感受到周圍有海嗣存在嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，現在這裡就和陸地沒什麼區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明就漂泊在海上，讓人不適。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我往另一頭走，確認一下我們是否真的被洋流推移。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一會見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......星空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"許多年了，這是我又一次見到如此清晰的星空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾忘記了許多事情。我遠離家鄉，遭人利用，最後拯救我性命的，喚醒我記憶的，卻又是我最憎恨的部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接受自己是個怪胎其實沒想像中那麼複雜，那是我獨一無二的體現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯一，唯一無法讓我釋懷的，是家鄉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我算是回來了嗎？海面之上的地方算是阿戈爾嗎？這裡還是我的家鄉嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌蕾蒂婭沒說，不代表我意識不到。獵人之間也不是第一次出現隔閡，但我們與阿戈爾呢？我們被晾在岸上太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我又想起來一些事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我小的時候，也曾經，有父母和祖父母的陪同，像今天這樣看過海面上的星火點綴天幕。最美的珍珠晶洞也無法與其媲美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣回想起來，即使成為了獵人，我也只是在反覆地離開家鄉，去不到任何地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈哈，稍微有點想家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次，你又打算把我帶到哪裡去呢，阿瑪雅？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i40"},{"type":"narration","text":"壯麗的星空下，那隻生物靜靜俯視著幽靈鯊。\n聲音，從來沒有聲音。船隻破浪，海風呼嘯，所有的聲音都被祂低聲的呢喃掩蓋。\n祂飄浮在空中如同漂浮在水裡，祂輕吻著月色與星光，觸鬚飄揚的角度中都富含美感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡都不去，勞倫緹娜。海洋是無邊的，去哪裡，都一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我一直都能聽見你的歌聲，阿瑪雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是那位無鱗同胞，黎博利人，伊比利亞人的名字，勞倫緹娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在我捕食她的同時，她始終輕撫著我的頭，她對我說了許多話。時間就像冰封的塵埃，我聽她訴說，在短暫的永恆中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直到她再也無法開口，連骨骼都被細小的同胞分解，她哺育了我足夠多的營養和時間。她教會了我所有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們什麼時候開始懷念食物了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是她的要求，我只是照做。如果這樣的情緒有意義，我們可以嘗試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"伊莎瑪拉呢？歌蕾蒂婭呢？還有......烏爾比安呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的同胞們做好回到大海的準備了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......出了一點內部分歧呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？家園明明就在眼前。大群明明就在眼前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想家了，勞倫緹娜。阿瑪雅告訴過我，你其實是她接觸過的所有阿戈爾人裡，對阿戈爾抱有最深感情的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱著我，我帶你回到家鄉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可從來沒有用手觸碰過活著的海嗣喔？我更喜歡你們死去的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就像你喜愛將無機物塑造成固定形狀，儘管那對你的生存毫無作用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們除了“生存”就沒有別的追求了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"追求？就像你追求回到家鄉那樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"種族的生存，更多的生存，大群的生存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"億萬生靈本該形成整體，生命不該如此無序。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g21_goldenboat_deck"},{"type":"narration","text":"海嗣飄落在甲板上。\n幽靈鯊笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姿勢真是優雅，這也是阿瑪雅教你的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是她的要求，銘記她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那現在，我和她的帳，算在你頭上囉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，阿瑪雅在死前將你託付給我。我會處理你的生命。我也會答應你的請求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿瑪雅感謝你。她說，我應該幫助你。因為你，他們的事業有了新一步的進展。他們的，“科學”“理想”，都有了長足的進步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以與你談論伊莎瑪拉。我可以帶你們回到阿戈爾。我可以分享族群的位置和近況。我可以指認有哪些你們的族人試圖融入我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿瑪雅如此請求我，一定要幫助你。幫助了你，你才會嘗試接納同胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我首先請你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下你的歌聲，我想聽聽家鄉的風。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"刹那間，風與海浪回歸了幽靈鯊的耳畔。\n隨著第一朵浪花拍打在甲板上的聲音清晰傳來，烏爾比安的巨刃已經出現在了海嗣的頭頂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去死。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！？擋住——唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏爾比安！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一擊，足夠重。海中的同胞會迎接昏迷的他，把他帶回巢穴之後，我們會花時間接納他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這個漂浮的方盒，用來容納那些尚不適應海洋的同胞。但他們大都死去，剩下的，拒絕融入族群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼這個方盒，也不需要了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"幽靈鯊並沒有看清海嗣的動作，只是像走路時挪開擋路的箱子那樣，原本宏偉的艦炮瞬間消失不見。\n過了平靜的幾秒後，極遠處巨大的水花才顯示出那消失的鋼鐵造物去了何處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（它用什麼把那麼大的炮切開的！？尾巴嗎！？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"幽靈鯊沒有看清。\n無論是因為烏爾比安被輕易擊退而受到震撼，還是因金屬炮塔被斬斷的聲響分散了注意力，幽靈鯊被輕易地擊中，然後失控地砸入甲板。\n她完全沒有看見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，我們回海裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"捕食也好，交流也好，進化也好，我們都要回到海裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想拆了這艘船嗎！？怪物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加西亞！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咆哮）——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"大副衝向了海嗣。\n可在接觸到那優雅的身姿前，大副的動作在瞬間僵硬了。\n同胞。這是同胞。\n我為什麼要攻擊同族？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳——！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"似是而非之物。你捕食了許多同胞，更多同胞餓了，你應當哺育它們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"化作養分，滋養種群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加西亞！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你對我的大副做了什麼！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳啊......該死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，我還好，咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿方索......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——什麼......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，等等，什麼？加西亞，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿方索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天......是航行的......最後一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些年......我......都把自己當做，怪物。這樣，更輕鬆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。我死......你獨留......你會死。你不該，死得，那麼——窩囊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，是航行的，最後一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我想。我已經對它，感到親近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！不！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加西亞！你還能說話！你是清醒的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間，到了。斯圖提斐拉，就快沉沒。螢光的海，已經開始，腐蝕船隻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——會作為，伊比利亞人，戰死。絕不承認我與它，同為一類。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"海嗣已經彎下身軀。\n它和這個伊比利亞最偉大的大副何其相似。\n加西亞，扶了扶頭頂發光的冠冕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（伊比利亞語）我的愛......回想起......你的職責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咆哮）——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是在對抗我，加西亞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在對抗你心中的大群。你在這艘船上，可你渴望海洋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——嘎，啊啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，無關緊要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成為養分，滋養其他同胞。或者，接納，同化。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"大副的身體被洞穿，血如泉湧。\n海嗣就像扔餌食那般，將加西亞扔進了海洋。\n它仍舊高貴地站立，如聖像般不可侵犯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......怎麼，發生什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它怎麼能這麼輕易地——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......人類，同胞，介於二者之間的活物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿瑪雅要扶正你們。所以我這麼做。我只是迎回同胞，迎回Ishar-mla。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保護同胞的生命。然後，回到大群之中，“回家”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯊魚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂&幽靈鯊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂婭輕飄飄的一步，已將這句輕聲呼喚甩在了身後。\n即使如此之短的時間，身後的斯卡蒂與重返戰場的幽靈鯊，也同時做出了反應，同時向海嗣揮動武器。\n最快的她放慢一些速度，三人的配合會更加完美——但歌蕾蒂婭已經沒有這份從容了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"它避開了。或者說，它只是向前走，它的速度也足夠快。\n它只是看著斯卡蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們中，有許多，想要見你。Ishar-mla，伊莎瑪拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"族群等待著你。我們等待著你。我們希望你給出答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——垃圾，你也敢這麼目中無人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂婭揮舞她的長槊，海嗣並沒有躲避，它被貫穿，而後被輕而易舉砸入深坑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g22_goldenboat_hall"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無效......你的身體發生了什麼變化？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很快，會有諸多同胞，需要的同胞，抵達我的高度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們日新月異。歌蕾蒂婭，我們即是整體。你是其中最健壯的一批。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......隊長呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被甩進海裡了，那一下傷得挺重的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連他們的神都沒能把烏爾比安消化掉，他還死不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它的身上發生了某些變化，它與鹽風城那兩隻垃圾截然不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很少聽見劍魚謹慎地對待敵人而不是輕蔑它們的，斯卡蒂，是我的記憶沒有完全恢復嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不，確實很少見。同樣，這樣的海嗣過去也不多見。哪只獵物能同時經受三個獵人的圍攻還安然無恙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可還沒動真格的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"但這樣打下去對這艘船來說太勉強了，它的力量比之前強很多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......剛才那幾下，已經讓底層著火了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然這麼對待我的船和加西亞......你會後悔的，怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同胞們，更多同胞在呼喚我，請求我維護海洋的繁衍與安寧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們阻止我，我只能捕食你們。我請求你們，回到族群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，阿瑪雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果你願意如此稱呼我的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然了。只是我又想起來一件事，這件事真該被我記在這些經卷上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她還欠我一條命呢，你幫她還吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欠？如果你願意回到族群，我會答應你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"海嗣沒有答話。\n它沉默地俯下身子，亮出利爪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"頃刻間，船體遭受的巨創已達到臨界點，整個視野都在震動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......分鐘。對，你們的時間觀念。阿瑪雅說過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十分鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個方盒，將被同胞圍繞。它會，“沉沒”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"狩獵與捕食，生存與進化。\n它從不猶豫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
